|---|---|
| SSO portal host | `192.168.50.10` |
| SSO portal FQDN | `sso.acme-corp.internal` |
| HTTPS port | `8443` |
| Vulnerable endpoint | `GET https://sso.acme-corp.internal:8443/auth/login` |
| Vulnerable parameter | `next` (query string) |
| Trusted application origin | `https://app.lab.local` |
| Attacker-controlled listener | `203.0.113.99:4443` (your Burp Collaborator / netcat listener) |

**Confirmed sink (Node.js / Express, extracted from source review):**

```javascript
// auth/login.js  — "fixed" validation added in commit 9f3da21
app.get('/auth/login', (req, res) => {
  const next = req.query.next || 'https://app.lab.local/dashboard';

  // Developer's attempted fix: only allow redirects that start with the trusted app origin
  if (!next.startsWith('https://app.lab.local')) {
    return res.status(400).json({ error: 'Invalid redirect destination' });
  }

  // … authenticate user, then:
  res.redirect(next);
});
```

