4. **State the single lab-only safety boundary you must maintain** to ensure the attack traffic stays within the test environment and does not route to the public internet or affect production systems.

Provide all deliverables as copy-pasteable, working artifacts (URL string, HTML file content) with inline comments explaining each part.

